task_type_fields.proposal:
Run the overlay-docked prompt bar experiment, so the plain `<space>` home prompt can reveal within the 60 ms key-to-paint p95 target set by epic sase-1ex (plan:202610/prompt_space_and_project_cycle_latency.md).

sase-1ex's acceptance bench (sase-1ex.12 note #1, 2026-10-03) shows the target was missed even with the hidden hot spare landed (sase-1ex.11):
- first_space: 321 -> 102 ms;
- steady_space p50/p95: 169/243 -> 114/143 ms;
- the plan's 110 ms fallback target was also missed.

The ctrl+n/p targets were met (burst p95 12 ms, handler about 1 ms). The remaining cost is the reflow and paint of revealing a bar docked inside the main layout. Docking the bar as an overlay layer would avoid re-laying out the Agents/Artifacts panes on reveal. Measure it first with tests/ace/tui/bench_prompt_bar_keys.py (first_space, steady_space) against the sase-1ex.12 numbers, then decide.
